Shared migration workflow (Module M). See ../docs/migrations.md.

- env.py               : shared Alembic environment (DATABASE_URL, metadata, exclusions)
- metadata_registry.py : where feature modules register their SQLModel models
- versions/            : ordered revisions; 0001_infrastructure_baseline is empty

Add a revision:  uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "<module>: <change>"
Apply:           DATABASE_URL=... uv run alembic upgrade head
